      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Thrombosis is a known adverse side effect associated with hormonal contraceptive use. Low-dose formulations, dominant in the market during the last several years, may also present such risk. This risk reputedly is more prevalent in older women; the following case demonstrates even very young women in otherwise good health may be at risk."},
